1
00:00:03,639 --> 00:00:05,760
When I was
in fifth grade

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,801
I pointed a
gun at a man

3
00:00:08,042 --> 00:00:09,402
and killed him

4
00:00:10,723 --> 00:00:11,884
That's garbage

5
00:00:11,924 --> 00:00:12,524
Villager

6
00:00:12,564 --> 00:00:13,885
you get it too

7
00:00:16,247 --> 00:00:17,288
Give me
the money now

8
00:00:17,328 --> 00:00:19,049
or I'm gonna
kill her next

9
00:00:19,089 --> 00:00:21,050
I swear I'll do it

10
00:00:22,611 --> 00:00:23,811
Sarge

11
00:00:33,026 --> 00:00:34,908
You little…

12
00:00:34,948 --> 00:00:35,549
give it back

13
00:00:35,589 --> 00:00:36,911
you brat，Let go

14
00:00:36,951 --> 00:00:39,313
Let go of my gun

15
00:00:56,968 --> 00:00:58,248
我拉動扳機三下

16
00:01:27,686 --> 00:01:29,288
Ever
since that day

17
00:01:29,328 --> 00:01:32,891
If I saw a gun on
TV or even a picture of one

18
00:01:32,931 --> 00:01:35,133
It would
trigger my PTSD

19
00:01:35,173 --> 00:01:37,574
And send me
into a panic attack

20
00:01:48,304 --> 00:01:49,705
Meds didn't help

21
00:01:49,745 --> 00:01:51,506
Counselling
didn't help

22
00:01:51,666 --> 00:01:54,388
Nothing helped me
get rid of my phobia

23
00:02:14,595 --> 00:02:15,996
我哋好醜

24
00:02:17,041 --> 00:02:17,961
迷わず今

25
00:02:18,081 --> 00:02:21,440
矛盾だらけの世界を

26
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:24,559
その手で打ち放て

27
00:03:51,964 --> 00:03:54,606
I thought if I
got as far away from home as I could

28
00:03:54,646 --> 00:03:56,648
to this high
school in Tokyo

29
00:03:56,688 --> 00:03:58,289
I'd get
better somehow

30
00:03:58,329 --> 00:04:00,170
But nothing changed

31
00:04:00,611 --> 00:04:01,691
Bang

32
00:04:01,932 --> 00:04:03,212
Looking back

33
00:04:03,453 --> 00:04:07,176
I don't have any
regrets pulling that trigger to protect my mom

34
00:04:07,256 --> 00:04:08,257
But the thing is

35
00:04:08,297 --> 00:04:10,499
I'm not strong
enough to convince myself

36
00:04:10,539 --> 00:04:12,620
It was the
best choice either

37
00:04:13,181 --> 00:04:15,181
Despite being
so screwed up

38
00:04:15,221 --> 00:04:17,581
I did make one
friend in Tokyo

39
00:04:17,702 --> 00:04:20,822
He was the one
who got me into playing Gungail Online

40
00:04:21,102 --> 00:04:22,822
