last qualifier

44
00:04:29,023 --> 00:04:31,143
You made it all
the way to the semifinals

45
00:04:31,183 --> 00:04:32,263
remember？

46
00:04:32,824 --> 00:04:33,865
Whatever

47
00:04:33,905 --> 00:04:37,109
