and see what happens

52
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,600
Nah

53
00:04:46,721 --> 00:04:47,522
no point

54
00:04:47,562 --> 00:04:48,883
I just die

55
00:04:49,084 --> 00:04:50,806
Uh oh，it's late

56
00:04:50,846 --> 00:04:51,767
Sorry

57
00:04:51,807 --> 00:04:53,528
I have to
get going now

58
00:04:56,050 --> 00:04:57,295
Thanks for the tea

59
00:04:57,335 --> 00:04:58,541
and thanks

60
00:04:58,581 --> 00:04:59,907
I mean thank you

61
00:04:59,947 --> 00:05:01,430
for saving me

62
00:05:01,714 --> 00:05:03,238
You were
pretty cool

63
00:05:04,134 --> 00:05:06,896
I wish I could
always be there to protect you

64
00:05:07,378 --> 00:05:08,339
Hey，uh

65
00:05:08,379 --> 00:05:09,260
if you want

66
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:10,782
I can walk you
home every day

67
00:05:10,822 --> 00:05:11,623
I mean

68
00:05:11,663 --> 00:05:13,024
if you want

69
00:05:13,184 --> 00:05:14,266
Oh，no，no

70
00:05:14,306 --> 00:05:15,627
that's okay

71
00:05:15,747 --> 00:05:16,829
I'll be fine

72
00:05:16,869 --> 00:05:19,231
It's the only way
I'll get stronger

73
00:05:19,792 --> 00:05:20,833
At the time

74
00:05:20,873 --> 00:05:24,037
