激啊…

82
00:06:28,513 --> 00:06:31,234
Maybe I will too
when I kill him

83
00:07:04,791 --> 00:07:07,072
I thought the
stronger Senon got in the game

84
00:07:07,112 --> 00:07:09,634
the stronger I'd
get in the real world

85
00:07:10,154 --> 00:07:12,396
I believed it
with every fibre in me

86
00:07:12,436 --> 00:07:15,597
So I took on all
comers with my Hecky too

87
00:07:18,039 --> 00:07:19,239
You're dead

88
00:07:49,034 --> 00:07:49,595
Yes

89
00:07:49,635 --> 00:07:51,277
it's my
first time

90
00:07:51,558 --> 00:07:54,161
I'm looking for a
place to buy a cheap gun

91
00:07:54,322 --> 00:07:54,883
Oh

92
00:07:54,923 --> 00:07:58,286
and I also need
to find out where the governor's office is

93
00:08:00,170 --> 00:08:02,413
I was on my way
over to sign up for the prelim

94
00:08:02,413 --> 00:08:04,616
s for the third
bullet of bullets tourney

95
00:08:04,656 --> 00:08:07,379
When I met a
player calling herself Kiritto

96
00:08:08,942 --> 00:08:10,584
Turns out
she was a he

97
