Boy did he
piss me off

99
00:08:15,070 --> 00:08:16,392
You're kidding？

100
00:08:16,432 --> 00:08:17,353
No way

101
00:08:17,393 --> 00:08:18,715
You're a guy？

102
00:08:18,755 --> 00:08:20,677
With that avatar？

103
00:08:29,410 --> 00:08:30,450
Why you？

104
00:08:32,697 --> 00:08:34,622
Even though he
pissed me off

105
00:08:34,704 --> 00:08:37,673
I could tell he
was fighting his own demons

106
00:08:38,638 --> 00:08:40,242
Just like I was

107
00:09:07,874 --> 00:09:09,874
He won't even
know what hit him

108
