124
00:10:22,429 --> 00:10:23,550
A game？

125
00:10:23,670 --> 00:10:26,833
Well just 'cause
you feel that way doesn't mean I do

126
00:10:31,799 --> 00:10:32,560
Senon

127
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:35,042
give me a chance
to make it right with you

128
00:10:35,083 --> 00:10:37,325
Let me give you
the fight I promised

129
00:11:02,154 --> 00:11:04,076
Okay，get set

130
