both know that

148
00:12:37,917 --> 00:12:38,718
It takes strength

149
00:12:38,758 --> 00:12:40,801
and all I wanna
know is how to get it

150
00:12:40,841 --> 00:12:42,042
It's what I…

151
00:12:42,564 --> 00:12:44,887
