would die from it？

156
00:12:53,574 --> 00:12:55,936
And what if you
had to kill that player？

157
00:12:55,976 --> 00:12:56,737
Cause if
you didn't

158
00:12:56,777 --> 00:12:59,258
you or someone
you love would die instead

159
00:12:59,619 --> 00:13:01,060
If you had
that power

160
00:13:01,100 --> 00:13:03,261
