pull that trigger？

161
00:13:10,402 --> 00:13:12,684
When death gun
drew down on me

162
00:13:12,724 --> 00:13:15,526
all the hope I'd
put into Senon's strength

163
00:13:15,566 --> 00:13:17,007
was shattered

164
00:13:19,049 --> 00:13:20,850
What time？54？

165
00:13:20,890 --> 00:13:22,171
Black Star？

166
00:13:31,499 --> 00:13:32,739
It's the gun

167
00:13:34,535 --> 00:13:35,415
Why…

168
00:13:36,375 --> 00:13:37,575
why here？

169
00:13:37,855 --> 00:13:39,935
Why does he
have that gun？

170
00:13:48,100 --> 00:13:49,981
Okay，then

171
00:13:50,021 --> 00:13:51,461
