178
00:14:09,397 --> 00:14:10,278
No，no

179
00:14:11,002 --> 00:14:11,524
not that

180
00:14:11,564 --> 00:14:13,327
Oh God

181
00:14:29,736 --> 00:14:31,456
Until Death
Gun shoots you

182
00:14:31,496 --> 00:14:33,657
the guy in your
place isn't gonna do anything

183
00:14:33,697 --> 00:14:34,657
okay？

184
00:14:35,377 --> 00:14:37,858
That's the rule
they set up for themselves

185
00:14:38,298 --> 00:14:41,699
But if you log
out now and wake up with his partner there

186
00:14:41,780 --> 00:14:43,140
he'll kill you

187
00:14:55,398 --> 00:14:57,080
Tell me you
got a plan

188
00:14:58,042 --> 00:15:00,163
We're going to
take out Death Gun

189
00:15:04,450 --> 00:15:06,331
Please， Hecate

190
00:15:06,612 --> 00:15:07,454
I'm weak

191
00:15:07,494 --> 00:15:09,495
