your strength

192
00:15:09,616 --> 00:15:11,939
The strength to
stand up for myself

193
00:15:11,979 --> 00:15:13,340
and move on

194
00:15:17,586 --> 00:15:19,027
Concentrate

195
00:15:19,589 --> 00:15:21,831
Home in on his
drive to kill

196
00:16:06,002 --> 00:16:07,005
家姐啊

197
00:16:55,817 --> 00:16:57,457
Damn it

198
00:16:57,497 --> 00:16:58,617
he's tough

199
00:16:59,097 --> 00:17:00,777
If I can
slow him down

200
00:17:00,817 --> 00:17:02,977
one second'
s all I need

201
00:17:03,377 --> 00:17:03,897
Right now

202
00:17:03,937 --> 00:17:07,217
Kiddito's trying
to get that closure he was talking about

203
00:17:07,577 --> 00:17:09,938
He's confronting
his demons from SAO by ta

204
00:17:09,938 --> 00:17:12,298
king on the
person who represents them

205
00:17:12,338 --> 00:17:13,458
Death Gun

206
00:17:14,179 --> 00:17:15,701
And the
reason he can

207
00:17:15,741 --> 00:17:17,582
