your partner too

228
00:19:30,118 --> 00:19:32,398
You won't kill
anyone anymore

229
00:19:32,438 --> 00:19:34,478
Laughing
Coffin's dead

230
00:20:06,324 --> 00:20:07,604
It's over

231
00:20:07,885 --> 00:20:08,725
Yeah

232
00:20:12,170 --> 00:20:13,570
