233
00:20:13,610 --> 00:20:15,170
Shino Asura

234
00:20:17,730 --> 00:20:20,130
Guess now we should probably get this journey over with

235
00:20:20,170 --> 00:20:21,090
huh？

236
00:20:21,850 --> 00:20:22,730
Yeah

237
00:20:23,050 --> 00:20:24,170
we should

238
00:20:25,810 --> 00:20:26,690
There

239
00:20:44,256 --> 00:20:46,578
我愛你，阿爾塞娜，我愛

